/P 175 0 R
/E (Managing money can be difficult, especially for students and young users, as traditional finance applications can feel complicated, overwhelming, and too focused on numbers and reports, making them difficult to stay motivated to use and not always designed around building saving habits. BUCKS was created to make financial management simpler, more engaging, and easier to understand by helping users track their money, manage budgets, save toward their goals, and build better financial habits.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
